# orientation left blank/"" to let draw_line_node compute it from
# from/to itself (per your "follows mark for 1/5, finds vertical or
# horizontal from the points" description) — pass it explicitly only if
# you want to force diagonal/ray-style behavior later.
string orientation
float32 from_x_mm
float32 from_y_mm
float32 to_x_mm
float32 to_y_mm
---
bool success
string message
---
string current_step
